# Brewfile for the '1password' profile — the 1Password app and its CLI.
#
# Split out of the core tier's old security slot: 1Password is a product
# choice, not something every machine wants. See docs/1password-as-ssh-agent.md
# for the SSH-agent setup this profile makes possible.

# Casks
cask '1password'
cask '1password-cli'
